Description: Wireless CarPlay receiver for rootless jailbreaks.
 Showcase turns a jailbroken iPhone or iPad into a wireless CarPlay
 receiver. This package uses the rootless layout under /var/jb and supports
 iOS 12 or newer.
 .
 Beta 5-2 turns on Prioritize Quality once and adds anonymous usage
 reporting, which Settings > Anonymous Usage turns off item by item.
 .
 This fork saves settings across launches and adds Flip Landscape
 Orientation under Settings > Display.
 .
 The prefs2 test build starts CarPlay services on Bluetooth readiness,
 reassembles fragmented iAP2 traffic, and recovers a stale Bluetooth key
 for a known sender. Pairing progress follows actual pairing requests.
 .
 The prefs3 build uses one-sided notch padding, finishes drags outside
 the video area, and bounds recovery waits during relaunch.
